go/1265/202303161834111090739.png\" alt=\"\" aria-label=\"Hardwareinside recommendation price/performance\" class=\"awardImage\"> <!----></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardMediaName__yE0u9\">\n      hardwareinside.de\n    </p> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardName__jAstt\"><p>Hardwareinside recommendation price/performance</p></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardDescription__KhisN\">\n      The ROG STRIX B760-G GAMING WIFI impressively proves that quality does not necessarily have to be associated with high costs. With its 12+1 power stages, it offers enough performance to drive even larger processors.\n    </p></div> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottom__4mvlW\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottomLeft__4xC-s\"><span>GERMANY</span> <span>03/09/2023</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG STRIX B760-G GAMING WIFI D4 Media review Award of Hardwareinside recommendation price/performance\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://www.hardwareinside.de/asus-rog-strix-b760-g-gaming-wifi-d4-im-test-72989/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemMoreLink__pG7gP\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" svg-inline alt=\"right\" role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M23.07 13.77L9.06 0v6.7l9.18 8.94-9.18 9.66V32l14.01-14.49 1.87-1.87-1.87-1.87z\"></path></svg></a></div></li><li class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardItem__qQut7\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemTop__AQaLj\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardImageBox__pTW-S\"><img  src=\"https://www.asus.com/media/images/award_logo/1263/202210062127446670946.png\" alt=\"\" aria-label=\"Coup de Coeur\" class=\"awardImage\"> <!----></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardMediaName__yE0u9\">\n      Pause Hardware\n    </p> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardName__jAstt\"><p>Coup de Coeur</p></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardDescription__KhisN\">\n      